                                                "sense_id": "f672a1a7-c322-3cc7-8080-3481bf428dfa",
                                                "text": "With our water goggles adjusted we gazed at the fishes displaying their polychromatic scales to the sea world, as, with true Puka-Pukan languor, they finned from coral to coral."
