                                                "sense_id": "f672a1a7-c322-3cc7-8080-3481bf428dfa",
                                                "text": "As I rounded the corner nearest my hotel the Afrite coachman of the polychromatic, nonpareil coat seized me, swung open the dungeony door of his peripatetic sarcophagus, flirted his feather duster and began his ritual: […]"
                                            }
